#: qml/ConfigBehavior.qml:50
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"If you're using this setting to work around an application that demands "
"attention too often, first look for a setting in the app to disable that "
"behavior. If you don't find one, consider reporting this as a bug to the "
"app's developer."
msgstr ""
"Ezarpen hau arreta maizegi eskatzen duen aplikazio baten jokabidea "
"saihesteko erabiltzen ari bazara, lehenik bilatu aplikazioan jokabide hori "
"desgaitzeko ezarpenik ba ote dagoen. Aurkitzen ez baduzu, kontuan hartu "
"aplikazioaren garatzaileari hau akats gisa jakinaraztea."

#: qml/ConfigBehavior.qml:98
msgctxt "@info displayed as InlineMessage"
msgid ""
"The compositor does not support displaying windows side by side, so a "
"textual list will be displayed instead."
msgstr ""
"Konposatzaileak ez du onartzen leihoak aurrez-aurre aurkeztea, beraz, horren"
" ordez, testu-zerrenda bat azalduko da."

